Misho, 13 Oct 19:05 UTC in the code session's chat: „ჩემგან ყვეკაფერზე
კია" (recorded as §140 with each text word for word).
- 2311: when the server's introduction is refused because the go-between
  never opened the app, the owner is told so and asked „მაინც
  გავუგზავნო?" instead of the generic not-sent line; nothing goes as a
  plain question.
- 4720: fetch_page's rule counts a company's own regulatory filing (an
  RNS) or annual report as the institution's own page.
- 4919: SHORT_TITLES_ON = true for new titles; existing ones are not
  back-filled (that spends model calls and is asked separately).

